00:35:54.610 --> 00:35:55.853
I appreciate it, thanks for having me on.

00:35:55.853 --> 00:35:57.900
All right, take care.

00:35:57.900 --> 00:36:00.240
That was great, that was fantastic.

00:36:00.240 --> 00:36:01.720
Yeah?
Yeah, we're done.

00:36:01.720 --> 00:36:03.450
That was good, that was--
Awesome.

00:36:03.450 --> 00:36:05.170
