00:36:12.700 --> 00:36:13.743
Nice, nice.

00:36:14.660 --> 00:36:17.070
Yeah, that was really terrific.

00:36:17.070 --> 00:36:18.360
That's pretty sweet, I appreciate that.

00:36:18.360 --> 00:36:20.560
Like I said, it's really enormous for us,

00:36:20.560 --> 00:36:22.447
