00:36:31.510 --> 00:36:33.150
No, no, no, it's what--

00:36:33.150 --> 00:36:35.170
This is how to get there, I hope.

00:36:35.170 --> 00:36:37.490
Wherever there is, it'll never be perfect,

00:36:37.490 --> 00:36:40.450
