00:37:06.560 --> 00:37:07.700
It'd be nice to talk.

00:37:07.700 --> 00:37:08.533
I'd love that too.

00:37:08.533 --> 00:37:10.668
Well, when we open stuff back up,

00:37:10.668 --> 00:37:12.388
